# Unit27
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit27核心词汇

relevant/ˈreləvənt/相关的/Please provide relevant documents.
reliable/rɪˈlaɪəbl/可靠的/He is a reliable person.
reluctant/rɪˈlʌktənt/不情愿的/She was reluctant to accept.
remarkable/rɪˈmɑːrkəbl/显著的/She has made remarkable progress.
remedy/ˈremədi/补救措施/There is no easy remedy.
remote/rɪˈmoʊt/遥远的/The village is in a remote area.
render/ˈrendər/使成为/The accident rendered him unconscious.
renew/rɪˈnuː/更新/She renewed her passport.
reproduce/ˌriːprəˈduːs/复制/The experiment is difficult to reproduce.
reputation/ˌrepjuˈteɪʃn/声誉/He has a good reputation.
rescue/ˈreskjuː/营救/The firefighters rescued the child.
resemble/rɪˈzembl/类似/She resembles her mother.
reserve/rɪˈzɜːrv/保留；预订/I'd like to reserve a table.
resign/rɪˈzaɪn/辞职/He resigned from his position.
resolve/rɪˈzɑːlv/解决/We must resolve this conflict.
resort/rɪˈzɔːrt/求助/We spent the weekend at a resort.
resource/ˈriːsɔːrs/资源/Natural resources should be protected.
respond/rɪˈspɑːnd/回应/She responded quickly to the email.
responsible/rɪˈspɑːnsəbl/负责的/She is responsible for marketing.
restore/rɪˈstɔːr/恢复/They restored the old building.
restrict/rɪˈstrɪkt/限制/The law restricts plastic use.
retain/rɪˈteɪn/保持/The company retained its top employees.
reveal/rɪˈviːl/揭示/The investigation revealed the truth.
revenue/ˈrevənuː/收入/Revenue increased by 20% this year.
reverse/rɪˈvɜːrs/反转/He reversed the car into the parking space.
revolution/ˌrevəˈluːʃn/革命/The industrial revolution changed the world.
reward/rɪˈwɔːrd/奖励/She received a reward for her work.
rhythm/ˈrɪðəm/节奏/She moved to the rhythm of the music.
rigid/ˈrɪdʒɪd/严格的/The rules are too rigid.
routine/ruːtiːn/日常/She follows a strict daily routine.
rural/ˈrʊrəl/农村的/He grew up in a rural area.
sacrifice/ˈsækrɪfaɪs/牺牲/She sacrificed her career for her family.
sample/ˈsæmpl/样本/The doctor took a blood sample.
satellite/ˈsætəlaɪt/卫星/The satellite orbits the earth.
scale/skeɪl/规模/The project is on a large scale.
scarce/skers/缺乏的/Fresh water is scarce in this region.
scheme/skiːm/计划/He devised a scheme to save money.
scope/skoʊp/范围/The scope of the project is broad.
segment/ˈseɡmənt/部分/This segment is growing rapidly.
senior/ˈsiːniər/高级的/He is a senior manager.
sensitive/ˈsensətɪv/敏感的/She is sensitive to criticism.
sequence/ˈsiːkwəns/顺序/Arrange the events in the correct sequence.
session/ˈseʃn/会议/The training session lasts two hours.
settle/ˈsetl/解决；定居/They settled the dispute out of court.
severe/sɪˈvɪr/严重的/He suffered severe injuries.
shelter/ˈʃeltər/避难所/The camp provides shelter.
shift/ʃɪft/转变/There has been a shift in public opinion.
shortage/ˈʃɔːrtɪdʒ/短缺/There is a shortage of skilled workers.
shrink/ʃrɪŋk/缩小/The economy shrank by 2%.
signal/ˈsɪɡnəl/信号/The traffic signal turned red.
